    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Dread Mob",
    "summary": "When an **ORKS WALKER** unit of yours, other than a **TITANIC** unit, is **selected to attack** in the Fight phase or your own Shooting phase, you may roll 1 or 2 D6, re-rolling duplicates until there are none. A duplicate means 2 dice in the same band below. Each die gives the unit's attacks:\n\n- A 1–2 gives +1 **A**.\n- A 3–4 gives +2 **S**.\n- A 5–6 gives +1 **AP**.\n\nRolling 2 dice also costs the unit 1 **[hazard roll](vsdata:core-rule/hazard-rolls)**, made after it has attacked.",
